---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import GitHubChart from "../components/GitHubChart.astro";
import { GLOBAL } from "../lib/config";
---

<Layout
  title="Professional Experience"
  description="8+ years of professional experience as Full Stack Engineer at Sirine.ai B.V, Oreala B.V, and Colan Infotech. Expertise in Go, Laravel, Vue, React, and leading technical initiatives."
  keywords="Professional Experience, Full Stack Engineer, Sirine.ai, Oreala B.V, Colan Infotech, Software Engineer Experience, Go Developer Experience, Laravel Developer Experience, Technical Leadership, Open Source Contributor"
>
  <section class="w-full py-10 space-y-8">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-wider mb-4">Professional Experience</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl xq-accent-muted leading-relaxed">
        8+ years of building scalable web applications and leading technical initiatives
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12">
      <article class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-6">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mb-1">Full Stack Engineer</h2>
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-2">
            <p class="text-lg font-medium xq-accent">Cognizant</p>
            <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Aug 2022 - Present</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">Chennai, India • Remote</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prose max-w-none">
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Building enterprise web applications and services using modern tech stack</li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Implementing scalable backend solutions with Java,Springboot and Microservices</li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Contributing to innovative AI solutions and product development</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300">Java</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-red-50 text-red-700 dark:bg-red-900/30 dark:text-red-300">Springboot</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-green-50 text-green-700 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-300">AI/ML</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:text-purple-300">Microservices</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-6">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mb-1">Full Stack Engineer</h2>
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-2">
            <p class="text-lg font-medium xq-accent">HCL</p>
            <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Apr 2022 - Jun 2025</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">Chennai, India • Remote</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prose max-w-none">
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Built and maintained enterprise applications and services using Go and Laravel, serving thousands of users</li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Designed and shipped a production invoice builder system with complex business logic</li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Led performance optimization initiatives, reducing page load times by 40%</li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Collaborated across teams to improve developer experience and establish coding standards</li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Mentored junior developers and conducted code reviews for quality assurance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300">Java</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-red-50 text-red-700 dark:bg-red-900/30 dark:text-red-300">Springboot</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-green-50 text-green-700 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-300">React JS</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-700 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 dark:text-yellow-300">PostgreSQL</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="border-l-4 border-purple-500 pl-6">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mb-1">Software Engineer</h2>
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-2">
            <p class="text-lg font-medium xq-accent">Ashvich Infotek Private Ltd</p>
            <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Jul 2018 - Mar 2022</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">Chennai, India • On-site</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prose max-w-none">
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Developed full-stack web applications using Laravel and modern JavaScript frameworks</li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Implemented RESTful APIs and integrated third-party services for client projects</li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Collaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver projects on time and within budget</li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">Participated in code reviews and helped establish development best practices</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-red-50 text-red-700 dark:bg-red-900/30 dark:text-red-300">Laravel</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-700 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 dark:text-yellow-300">JavaScript</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300">MySQL</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-green-50 text-green-700 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-300">APIs</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="border-l-4 border-gray-400 pl-6">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mb-1">Open Source & Personal Projects</h2>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">2016 - Present</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prose max-w-none">
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">
              Actively contribute to open source community through various projects focused on developer tools and learning resources
            </li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">
              Created and maintain coding standards and best practices documentation for web development frameworks
            </li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">
              Developed interactive portfolio templates and boilerplate projects to help other developers
            </li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">
              Built modern web application starters combining latest frontend and backend technologies
            </li>
            <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">
              Regular contributor to developer community through code, documentation, and knowledge sharing
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-gray-900 text-white dark:bg-gray-700">Open Source</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-red-50 text-red-700 dark:bg-red-900/30 dark:text-red-300">Laravel</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-green-50 text-green-700 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-300">Vue.js</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300">Go</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-wider">GitHub Contributions</h2>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg xq-accent-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
          My coding activity and contributions to open source projects
        </p>
        <GitHubChart className="mx-auto" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="text-center p-6 border xq-border rounded-lg">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold xq-accent mb-2">8+</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Years Experience</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-6 border xq-border rounded-lg">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold xq-accent mb-2">50+</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Projects Delivered</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
